  "projectOverlays": {
   "root": "Zano",
   "rule": "SDK source owned by this project: the Darwin provisioning port (first two paths) and SDK source revision v2, the epee-owned MARK_AS_POD_C11 registration with the DB codec guards reading it (last two paths). In the snapshot they are root content. root is relative to this wrapper (its Zano checkout at the snapshot root); admit_snapshot compares the composed bytes with that checkout, and the consuming app's stage records them.",
